        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589-a14">

                <pb facs="0554" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg480"/>

                <head>No. 14.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-07">February 7, 1865</date>—8 o’clock a.
                    m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">United States Consular Agent at Ferrol:</hi></p>
                <p>Today countermand last evening’s order issued to suspend wholly works on the
                    Stonewall. Make this known to the authorities, renewing your protest.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HORATIO J. PERRY,<hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d
                        Affaires.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
